Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Zoro finally learned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:02.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,directions?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:03.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,A map just felt unfamiliar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:04.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:05.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nami tests him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Left means left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:07.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:08.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bro unlocked a feature available
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,on most shopping carts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:11.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,He reaches the meeting first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:12.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then the enemy base.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:13.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:14.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,His crew isn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Early doesn't mean invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,He's inside an ambush with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,three swords and zero emotional
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:19.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,support.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:20.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Luffy is still causing trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:23.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,We fixed navigation, not the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:24.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,crew's relationship with\Nplanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:26.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Zoro spots extra guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,This time he knows how
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,far away his backup is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:29.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,So he retreats and marks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:31.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,the approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Character development arrives\Nwearing earrings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:34.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,and refusing eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,He warns Nami. They pick a\Nbetter route
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:37.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,and arrive together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:38.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,The enemies lose their easiest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:39.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:40.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now he fights with cover
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:41.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,instead of auditioning for a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,cautionary flashback.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:45.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Timing beats stubbornness here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:46.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,He still argues with\Ninstructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:47.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,His complaints reach the correct
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:48.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,address.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:50.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nami buys a compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Zoro asks if it comes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,in sword form.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Navigation needs a damage stat,\Napparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:56.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,They finally travel together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:57.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Luffy points toward the wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.22,0:00:58.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:00:59.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:00.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,The navigation disease found\Nanother host.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.16,Heading,,0,0,0,,GPS HAS ENTERED THE CHAT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.16,0:00:09.91,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE NAVIGATOR IS SUSPICIOUS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.91,0:00:14.29,Heading,,0,0,0,,ARRIVING BEFORE THE PLOT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.29,0:00:19.46,Heading,,0,0,0,,EARLY IS NOT INVINCIBLE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.46,0:00:24.72,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE CAPTAIN IS STILL THE CAPTAIN
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.72,0:00:28.77,Heading,,0,0,0,,SOMETHING IS WRONG HERE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.77,0:00:34.47,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE SMART MOVE IS BACKWARD
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.47,0:00:39.62,Heading,,0,0,0,,A RENDEZVOUS FOR ONCE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.62,0:00:44.93,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE REAL UPGRADE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.93,0:00:48.65,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE JOKE CHANGES SHAPE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.65,0:00:54.58,Heading,,0,0,0,,SWORDS HAVE OPTIONS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.58,0:01:01.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE FINAL TURN
